  ],
  "instructions": "Write study notes for a lecture or talk. Key points are the main ideas in order. Definitions give a term and its meaning as the speaker defined it. Examples are the examples the speaker gave. Finish with exactly five review questions that the lecture answers, each with a short answer.",
